{"id":"e8edb0ea1617bd4e","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-projection.md","title":"Projection Function","display":"df-projection — Projection Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projection","aliases":["58-df-projection"],"display":"df-projection — Projection Function","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection — Projection Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,B,n,i\\in V\">\\(X,Y,B,n,i\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times Y\">\\(X\\times Y\\)</span> (Cartesian product, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2,\\operatorname{pr}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2,\\operatorname{pr}_i\\)</span> (coordinate projections defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> (projection of a binary relation onto <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}binary} \\vdash \\operatorname{pr}_1:X\\times Y\\to X,\\;\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=x,\\qquad\\operatorname{pr}_2:X\\times Y\\to Y,\\;\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=y\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}binary} \\vdash \\operatorname{pr}_1:X\\times Y\\to X,\\;\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=x,\\qquad\\operatorname{pr}_2:X\\times Y\\to Y,\\;\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=y\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}coordinate} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_i:X^n\\to X\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in X^n\\;(\\operatorname{pr}_i(\\vec x)=\\vec x(i))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}coordinate} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_i:X^n\\to X\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in X^n\\;(\\operatorname{pr}_i(\\vec x)=\\vec x(i))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\forall B\\subseteq X\\times Y\\;\\bigl(\\pi_X(B)=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\forall B\\subseteq X\\times Y\\;\\bigl(\\pi_X(B)=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> 是二元笛卡尔积上的投影函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元笛卡尔积上第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个分量的投影</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{proj}(B) \\coloneqq \\pi_X(B) = \\{x \\in X : \\exists y \\in Y\\;((x, y) \\in B)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{proj}(B) \\coloneqq \\pi_X(B) = \\{x \\in X : \\exists y \\in Y\\;((x, y) \\in B)\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\times Y$ (Cartesian product, see [[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,B,n,i\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2,\\operatorname{pr}_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}binary} \\vdash \\operatorname{pr}_1:X\\times Y\\to X,\\;\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=x,\\qquad\\operatorname{pr}_2:X\\times Y\\to Y,\\;\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=y","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}coordinate} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i<n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_i:X^n\\to X\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in X^n\\;(\\operatorname{pr}_i(\\vec x)=\\vec x(i))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\forall B\\subseteq X\\times Y\\;\\bigl(\\pi_X(B)=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{proj}(B) \\coloneqq \\pi_X(B) = \\{x \\in X : \\exists y \\in Y\\;((x, y) \\in B)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1421,"backlinks":[{"id":"2d66c874fb7ff31a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\pi_X(A)$ 为二元关系向 $X$ 的投影（see [[../batch13/58-df-projection.md]]）"},{"id":"d4ac523055965e48","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\pi_X$ (first-coordinate projection, see [[58-df-projection]])"},{"id":"e1e5dca961f5c9ef","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\forall u,f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle u,f\\rangle)=u\\bigr)$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-projection.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-999","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-projection.md|58-df-projection]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["445e1cd0bb5274eb","2b6b1d9eb78a2714","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}